<rect x="1245" y="650" width="1085" height="72" rx="14" fill="#eef8fe" stroke="#8fcdee" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="1281" cy="686.0" r="22" fill="#0b8fd3"/><text x="1281" y="694.0" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="22" font-weight="800" fill="#fff" text-anchor="middle">4</text><text x="1319" y="695.0" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="25" font-weight="700" fill="#10233f" text-anchor="start">Dados bancários do cliente / favorecido</text><path d="M1787,722 L1787,738" stroke="#0b8fd3" stroke-width="4" fill="none" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/><rect x="1245" y="740" width="1085" height="72" rx="14" fill="#eef8fe" stroke="#8fcdee" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="1281" cy="776.0" r="22" fill="#0b8fd3"/><text x="1281" y="784.0" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="22" font-weight="800" fill="#fff" text-anchor="middle">5</text><text x="1319" y="785.0" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="25" font-weight="700" fill="#10233f" text-anchor="start">Anexar a documentação comprobatória</text><path d="M1787,812 L1787,828" stroke="#0b8fd3" stroke-width="4" fill="none" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/><rect x="1245" y="830" width="1085" height="72" rx="14" fill="#eef8fe" stroke="#8fcdee" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="1281" cy="866.0" r="22" fill="#0b8fd3"/><text x="1281" y="874.0" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="22" font-weight="800" fill="#fff" text-anchor="middle">6</text><text x="1319" y="875.0" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="25" font-weight="700" fill="#10233f" text-anchor="start">Informar a conta em que o valor foi recebido</text><path d="M1787,902 L1787,918" stroke="#0b8fd3" stroke-width="4" fill="none" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/><rect x="1245" y="920" width="1085" height="72" rx="14" fill="#eef8fe" stroke="#8fcdee" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="1281" cy="956.0" r="22" fill="#0b8fd3"/><text x="1281" y="964.0" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="22" font-weight="800" fill="#fff" text-anchor="middle">7</text><text x="1319" y="950.0" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="25" font-weight="700" fill="#10233f" text-anchor="start">Enviar à Tesouraria</text><text x="1319" y="980.0" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="20" font-weight="500" fill="#4b5d78" text-anchor="start">Não passa pela fila geral de Aprovações</text><polygon points="1787,1010.0 2022.0,1072 1787,1134.0 1552.0,1072" fill="#fff2bf" stroke="#e0a106" stroke-width="3"/><text x="1787" y="1066" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="24" font-weight="700" fill="#3a2a00" text-anchor="middle">Socorro (Tesouraria)</text><text x="1787" y="1096" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="24" font-weight="700" fill="#3a2a00" text-anchor="middle">confirma o crédito?</text><text x="1465" y="1026" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="24" font-weight="800" fill="#d90429" text-anchor="middle">NÃO</text><text x="2115" y="1026" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="24" font-weight="800" fill="#07913d" text-anchor="middle">SIM</text><path d="M1552,1072 L1395,1072 L1395,1157" stroke="#d90429" stroke-width="5" fill="none" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/><path d="M2022,1072 L2075,1072 L2075,1157" stroke="#07913d" stroke-width="5" fill="none" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/><rect x="1245" y="1167" width="450" height="84" rx="14" fill="#fff1f3" stroke="#e9a0aa" stroke-width="2"/><text x="1267" y="1203.0" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="24" font-weight="700" fill="#10233f" text-anchor="start">Devolvido à origem</text><text x="1267" y="1233.0" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="20" font-weight="500" fill="#c8102e" text-anchor="start">Corrigir e reenviar à Tesouraria</text><rect x="1775" y="1167" width="555" height="84" rx="14" fill="#effbf3" stroke="#7fc99a" stroke-width="2"/><text x="1797" y="1203.0" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="24" font-weight="700" fill="#10233f" text-anchor="start">Recebido pela Tesouraria</text><text x="1797" y="1233.0" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="20" font-weight="500" fill="#4b5d78" text-anchor="start">Crédito confirmado pela data</text><path d="M2052.5,1251 L2052.5,1269" stroke="#07913d" stroke-width="4" fill="none" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/><rect x="1775" y="1271" width="555" height="150" rx="14" fill="#f4efff" stroke="#b19ce8" stroke-width="2"/><text x="1797" y="1305" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="22" font-weight="800" fill="#3b2a8a" text-anchor="start">O sistema gera automaticamente:</text><text x="1797" y="1339" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="20" font-weight="600" fill="#3b2a8a" text-anchor="start">• Repasse de Alvarás (valor do cliente)</text><text x="1797" y="1367" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="20" font-weight="600" fill="#3b2a8a" text-anchor="start">• Comissões de Agentes (se houver)</text><text x="1797" y="1395" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="20" font-weight="600" fill="#3b2a8a" text-anchor="start">• Nota Fiscal e Repasse Societário</text><path d="M2052.5,1421 L2052.5,1439" stroke="#07913d" stroke-width="4" fill="none" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/><rect x="1775" y="1441" width="555" height="76" rx="14" fill="#eef5ff" stroke="#8bb4ea" stroke-width="2"/><text x="1797" y="1488.0" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="24" font-weight="700" fill="#10233f" text-anchor="start">Fernando classifica na DRE → Encerrar</text><rect x="1245" y="1560" width="1085" height="60" rx="12" fill="#eef8fe" stroke="none" stroke-width="2"/><text x="1270" y="1598" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="20" font-weight="700" fill="#0a6fa6" text-anchor="start">Reflexos: Auditoria, Fluxo de Caixa, Calendário, Conciliação Bancária, Contabilidade e DRE Gerencial</text><rect x="40" y="1670" width="2320" height="300" rx="22" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#9fd9c0" stroke-width="2"/><rect x="40" y="1670" width="2320" height="92" rx="22" fill="#0f9d6b" stroke="none" stroke-width="2"/><text x="80" y="1712" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="32" font-weight="800" fill="#fff" text-anchor="start">Repasse de Alvarás e Comissões de Agentes</text><text x="80" y="1745" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="21" font-weight="500" fill="#ffffff" text-anchor="start">Nascem do recebimento confirmado — o valor do cliente é dinheiro de terceiro, não é despesa do escritório</text><rect x="70" y="1810" width="520" height="100" rx="14" fill="#ecfaf3" stroke="#7fd0ab" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="106" cy="1860.0" r="22" fill="#0f9d6b"/><text x="106" y="1868.0" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="22" font-weight="800" fill="#fff" text-anchor="middle">1</text><text x="144" y="1854.0" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="25" font-weight="700" fill="#10233f" text-anchor="start">Reinaldo programa</text><text x="144" y="1884.0" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="20" font-weight="500" fill="#4b5d78" text-anchor="start">À vista ou parcelado · deduções na comissão</text><path d="M590,1860 L638,1860" stroke="#0f9d6b" stroke-width="5" fill="none" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/><rect x="640" y="1810" width="520" height="100" rx="14" fill="#ecfaf3" stroke="#7fd0ab" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="676" cy="1860.0" r="22" fill="#0f9d6b"/><text x="676" y="1868.0" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="22" font-weight="800" fill="#fff" text-anchor="middle">2</text><text x="714" y="1854.0" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="25" font-weight="700" fill="#10233f" text-anchor="start">Enviar para aprovação</text><text x="714" y="1884.0" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="20" font-weight="500" fill="#4b5d78" text-anchor="start">Dentro do próprio módulo</text><path d="M1160,1860 L1208,1860" stroke="#0f9d6b" stroke-width="5" fill="none" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/><rect x="1210" y="1810" width="520" height="100" rx="14" fill="#ecfaf3" stroke="#7fd0ab" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="1246" cy="1860.0" r="22" fill="#0f9d6b"/><text x="1246" y="1868.0" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="22" font-weight="800" fill="#fff" text-anchor="middle">3</text><text x="1284" y="1854.0" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="25" font-weight="700" fill="#10233f" text-anchor="start">Fernando ou Flávio aprova</text><text x="1284" y="1884.0" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="20" font-weight="500" fill="#4b5d78" text-anchor="start">Ou devolve para ajuste</text><path d="M1730,1860 L1778,1860" stroke="#0f9d6b" stroke-width="5" fill="none" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/><rect x="1780" y="1810" width="520" height="100" rx="14" fill="#ecfaf3" stroke="#7fd0ab" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="1816" cy="1860.0" r="22" fill="#0f9d6b"/><text x="1816" y="1868.0" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="22" font-weight="800" fill="#fff" text-anchor="middle">4</text><text x="1854" y="1854.0" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="25" font-weight="700" fill="#10233f" text-anchor="start">Socorro paga cada parcela</text><text x="1854" y="1884.0" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="20" font-weight="500" fill="#4b5d78" text-anchor="start">Pela data efetiva — fica na Auditoria</text><rect x="40" y="1995" width="2320" height="420" rx="22" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#c9bdf0" stroke-width="2"/><rect x="40" y="1995" width="2320" height="92" rx="22" fill="#5b3cc4" stroke="none" stroke-width="2"/><text x="80" y="2037" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="32" font-weight="800" fill="#fff" text-anchor="start">Sub-fluxo automático: Repasse Societário</text><text x="80" y="2070" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="21" font-weight="500" fill="#ffffff" text-anchor="start">Disparado pela Receita com honorários — não é uma decisão manual da Tesouraria</text><rect x="1860" y="2009" width="470" height="66" rx="12" fill="#7b60dc" stroke="none" stroke-width="2"/><text x="2095" y="2037" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="19" font-weight="700" fill="#fff" text-anchor="middle">Honorários − 11,33% de impostos = líquido</text><text x="2095" y="2063" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="20" font-weight="800" fill="#fff" text-anchor="middle">Ana Paula Müller 40% · Flávio 60%</text><rect x="70" y="2120" width="560" height="96" rx="14" fill="#f3efff" stroke="#b19ce8" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="106" cy="2168.0" r="22" fill="#5b3cc4"/><text x="106" y="2176.0" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="22" font-weight="800" fill="#fff" text-anchor="middle">1</text><text x="144" y="2162.0" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="25" font-weight="700" fill="#10233f" text-anchor="start">Apurado automaticamente</text><text x="144" y="2192.0" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="20" font-weight="500" fill="#4b5d78" text-anchor="start">Ana Paula Müller: 40% do líquido</text><path d="M630,2168 L690,2168" stroke="#5b3cc4" stroke-width="5" fill="none" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/><rect x="692" y="2120" width="420" height="96" rx="14" fill="#f3efff" stroke="#b19ce8" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="728" cy="2168.0" r="22" fill="#5b3cc4"/><text x="728" y="2176.0" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="22" font-weight="800" fill="#fff" text-anchor="middle">2</text><text x="766" y="2177.0" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="25" font-weight="700" fill="#10233f" text-anchor="start">Enviar para aprovação</text><path d="M1112,2168 L1170,2168" stroke="#5b3cc4" stroke-width="5" fill="none" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/><polygon points="1415,2103.0 1655.0,2168 1415,2233.0 1175.0,2168" fill="#fff2bf" stroke="#e0a106" stroke-width="3"/><text x="1415" y="2162" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="24" font-weight="700" fill="#3a2a00" text-anchor="middle">Fernando (Master) ou</text><text x="1415" y="2192" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="24" font-weight="700" fill="#3a2a00" text-anchor="middle">Flávio (Diretor) aprova?</text><text x="1395" y="2273" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="24" font-weight="800" fill="#d90429" text-anchor="end">NÃO</text><path d="M1415,2233 L1415,2295" stroke="#d90429" stroke-width="4" fill="none" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/><rect x="1215" y="2297" width="400" height="72" rx="14" fill="#fff1f3" stroke="#e9a0aa" stroke-width="2"/><text x="1237" y="2342.0" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="24" font-weight="700" fill="#c8102e" text-anchor="start">Rejeitado — ajusta e reenvia</text><text x="1700" y="2145" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="24" font-weight="800" fill="#07913d" text-anchor="middle">SIM</text><path d="M1655,2168 L1745,2168" stroke="#07913d" stroke-width="5" fill="none" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/><rect x="1747" y="2128" width="580" height="80" rx="14" fill="#effbf3" stroke="#7fc99a" stroke-width="2"/><text x="1769" y="2177.0" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="24" font-weight="700" fill="#10233f" text-anchor="start">3 · Aprovado → 4 · Enviado à Tesouraria</text><path d="M2037,2208 L2037,2235" stroke="#07913d" stroke-width="4" fill="none" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/><rect x="1747" y="2237" width="580" height="96" rx="14" fill="#eef5ff" stroke="#8bb4ea" stroke-width="2"/><text x="1769" y="2279.0" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="24" font-weight="700" fill="#10233f" text-anchor="start">5 · Socorro paga ou cancela</text><text x="1769" y="2309.0" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="20" font-weight="500" fill="#4b5d78" text-anchor="start">Nunca pode ser excluído</text><rect x="40" y="2440" width="2320" height="150" rx="16" fill="#eef2f7" stroke="none" stroke-width="2"/><text x="1200" y="2486" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="22" font-weight="700" fill="#06245c" text-anchor="middle">Exclusão de Despesas e Receitas pela IA: só o Fernando, digitando EXCLUIR — registrada na Auditoria e com opção de desfazer.</text><text x="1200" y="2522" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="21" font-weight="500" fill="#294267" text-anchor="middle">Bloqueada se o lançamento estiver conciliado em mês com conciliação fechada ou se a receita já gerou repasse, comissão ou nota.</text><text x="1200" y="2562" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="21" font-weight="700" fill="#294267" text-anchor="middle">Os documentos devem permanecer anexados no sistema, evitando o envio e a circulação de documentos em papel.</text></svg>